# Secrets and operator state. The build is `COPY . .`, and the resulting image is
# `docker save`d and shipped to worker hosts — anything listed here would otherwise
# travel with it. deploy-envs/ holds generated SECRET_KEY/S3/Postgres credentials and
# backups/ holds full database dumps, so both are excluded outright rather than by
# extension.
.env
.env.*
# …but the template must ship: it is what the docs tell operators to copy.
!.env.example
deploy.env
deploy-envs/
backups/
data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
# Recursive on purpose. A bare `.git/` matches only the repository root, and the vendored
# rule sets under tools/ arrive as clones — tools/hayabusa/rules/.git alone is 103 MB of
# pack files that `COPY . .` would bake into every image shipped to a worker host.
# scripts/package.sh uses the recursive `-xr!.git` for the same reason.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
uploads/
*.db
*.log
# …except the shipped samples. `*.log` is meant to exclude *runtime* logs, but it is a
# recursive pattern, so it would also strip the Linux samples out of every image — while
# the in-app docs at /docs tell the reader to try `samples/linux/syslog_intrusion.log`.
# Negations must come after the pattern they undo.
!samples/**/*.log
.pdm-python
# The Tailwind standalone CLI is ~46 MB of build tooling, gitignored but present in the
# build context on any machine where `task tailwind:install` has run — and `COPY . .`
# reads the context, not git. scripts/package.sh excludes it too.
tools/tailwind/
# The go-task copy ./logstotal runs on the host, and the tarballs a release carries for it:
# nothing inside a container runs a task.
.bin/
tools/go-task/
# The built documentation website.
site/
.venv/
logs/
.vscode/
.claude/
.github/
.forgejo/
# Local development notes, gitignored — but `COPY . .` reads the build context, not git,
# so a build from a working checkout would bake them into the image. Keep this list in
# step with scripts/package.sh, and name BOTH files: `task ci:artifacts` fails on any
# checkout that has the second one.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE-internals.md
AGENTS.md
.cursor/
.superpowers/
security-review/
tests/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
logstotal-*.7z
.DS_Store
.__*
__MACOSX/
.Spotlight-V100/
.Trashes/
.fseventsd/

# Private keys for PROXY_TLS=custom — mounted at runtime, never baked into an image.
certs/

.env.deploy.sha256
